casca-cluster-com-ia = AI cluster…
casca-mostra-aqui-as-janelas-dos-programas = Shows the windows of the server's graphical programs here. Trusted is ssh -Y and untrusted is ssh -X. Default follows Settings > X11 and tunnels. Requires X11Forwarding yes and xauth on the server, and an X server on this machine.
casca-mova-as-sessoes-para-a-janela = Move the sessions to the main window to keep them open, or close them along with the window.
